{"unit_id":"HTROY__dsh-terminal-font#feature-1","repo":"HTROY/dsh-terminal-font","commit":"ef85b9be303fe8cbe34ae3388b9f1a5288c38d52","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Terminal Font 的功能「终端字体设置」：在设置页启用或关闭自定义字体，输入已安装字体名称或使用推荐 Nerd Font 字体栈；保存后应用到终端实例。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:602-679"]}
{"unit_id":"HTROY__dsh-terminal-font#feature-2","repo":"HTROY/dsh-terminal-font","commit":"ef85b9be303fe8cbe34ae3388b9f1a5288c38d52","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Terminal Font 的功能「终端字号调整」：通过字号步进控件调整终端字体大小，或选择自动沿用终端原字号；字体关闭或自动字号会恢复原始设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:167-194","client.js:683-721"]}
{"unit_id":"HTROY__dsh-terminal-font#feature-3","repo":"HTROY/dsh-terminal-font","commit":"ef85b9be303fe8cbe34ae3388b9f1a5288c38d52","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Terminal Font 的功能「字号变化后重新适配」：字体或字号更新后重放终端测量回调，使 xterm 网格与关联 PTY 尺寸重新适配；无法取得回调时尝试备用 fit 路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:197-235"]}
{"unit_id":"HTROY__dsh-terminal-font#feature-4","repo":"HTROY/dsh-terminal-font","commit":"ef85b9be303fe8cbe34ae3388b9f1a5288c38d52","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Terminal Font 的功能「字形预览」：设置页展示 Powerline、分支和常用图标字形，并提示预览为方块时检查字体是否已安装或名称是否正确。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:573-577","client.js:725-749"]}
{"unit_id":"HTROY__dsh-terminal-font#caveat-1","repo":"HTROY/dsh-terminal-font","commit":"ef85b9be303fe8cbe34ae3388b9f1a5288c38d52","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Terminal Font 通过模块加载器、ResizeObserver 和 React fiber 等内部接缝取得终端实例；相关 DSH 组件实现变动时，字体应用或重新适配可能失效。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:353-376","client.js:258-312"]}
